SF0159 Dental insurance.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Jones, Barlow, Cooper and Crago and
Representative(s) Wylie
AN ACT relating to the insurance code; providing dental insurance requirements
for billing and coding as specified; providing definitions; specifying
applicability; and providing for an effective date.
